* Hello, World! — output to line printer (device 18)
* Printer block: 24 words = 120 chars
* Open the Printer tab in the I/O panel to see output.

BUF     EQU     100
        ORIG    BUF
        ALF     HELLO         * H E L L O
        CON     6882509       * " WORL"  (space W O R L)
        CON     67108864      * "D    "  (D then spaces)
        ORIG    3000
START   OUT     BUF(18)       * send 24-word block to printer
        HLT
        END     START
